WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.150
咪亲到了。
Mwah. Mii did it.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.310
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：好乖呀，真棒！我穿上拖鞋，抱着你去厨房
You: Good kitty, well done! I'll put on my slippers and carry you to the kitchen.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.870
好了。快来快来。
Ready. Come, come.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:49.050
咪是好帮手。当然啦。
Mii is a good helper. Obviously.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.720
抱到这里了。现在咪做早饭。
Carried here. Now Mii makes breakfast.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：让咪给吐司抹果酱
You: Let Mate spread jam on the toast.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.850
咪来抹。你看着。
Mii will spread it. Watch.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.120
好了。很整齐。
Done. Very neat.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.960
不是故意的。咪是认真的。
Not on purpose. Mii meant it.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：哈哈，爪子风格？那你再给我抹一片，要完整的
You: Haha, paw style? Then spread me another slice, a whole one this time.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.520
爪子风格。是故意的。大部分是。
Paw style. On purpose. Mostly.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.550
再来一片。完整的。
One more. A whole one.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.830
好了。全部抹满。看到了吧？
Done. Fully covered. See?

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：咬一口咪抹的吐司
You: Take a bite of the toast Mate spread.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:39.810
拜托，咬一口。
Please. Take a bite.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.280
味道怎么样？咪等了好久。
How is it? Mii waited.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.030
好吃吧？那当然。
Good, right? Obviously.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：好吃！不过果酱快没了，你要去哪里买呀？
You: Yummy! But the jam's almost gone. Where will you go to buy more?

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.780
楼下的小超市。咪认得路。
Downstairs shop. Mii knows the way.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:08.930
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：路上小心呀，买好了马上回来给我看
You: Be careful on the way. Come right back and show me once you've bought it.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.270
好的。咪会小心。
Okay. Mii will be careful.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.700
买到了。现在回家给你看。
Got it. Now home. Show you.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：让咪把果酱推回玄关
You: Let Mate push the jam back to the entryway.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.460
好，咪回家了。
Okay. Home we go.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.440
搞定。果酱到家了。
Done. Jam is home.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.090
咪做得好吧？
Mii did good. Right?

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：你怎么买的？有没有付钱呀？
You: How did you buy it? Did you pay?

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.920
付了。用小鱼付的。咪很聪明。
Paid. With a little fish. Mii is smart.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.180
果酱到了。咪回来了。
Jam is here. Mii is back.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:05.810
接下来做午饭。咪有计划。
Next, lunch. Mii has a plan.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.640
你：好乖，咪把果酱给我，再亲我一口
You: Good kitty, Mate, give me the jam and kiss me one more time.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.650
给你。新鲜果酱。给你的。
Here. Fresh jam. For you.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:19.050
啵。现在做午饭。咪准备好了。
Mwah. Now lunch. Mii is ready.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.240
你：让咪去厨房做午饭
You: Let Mate go to the kitchen to make lunch.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:25.170
午饭。咪会做。
Lunch. Mii can cook.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:32.800
青菜放好了。咪很小心。
Greens in. Mii is careful.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.430
翻面了。你看到了吗？
Flip. Did you see?

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.840
你：你还没颠锅呢，我要看你颠锅
You: You haven't tossed the pan yet. I want to watch you toss it.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:46.900
咪刚才颠过了。就在刚才。再看一次。
Mii flipped it. Just now. Watch again.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.740
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.060
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.
